{"performing-melissomelos-1":{"content":"<p>There is a sense in which Butler, in writing this music, is inviting his readers to inhabit the beehive</p>\n","id":"performing-melissomelos-1","article":"performing-melissomelos"},"sound-in-feminine-monarchie-1":{"content":"<p>At the time\nButler was writing, sound was the most reliable way to gain an insight\ninto the interior of the beehive in its normal, working state</p>\n","id":"sound-in-feminine-monarchie-1","article":"sound-in-feminine-monarchie"}}